# Two-param function type alias: [Mapper: [type [let a b] [Fn@b [a b]]]]
# represents (a, b) → b. [@[Mapper Integer String]] expands to [Fn@String [Integer String]].
# The lambda takes two params and returns the second (String-typed).
[
  Mapper: [type [let a b] [Fn@b [a b]]]
  f: [@[Mapper Integer String] [fn [let _ q] q]]
  result: [f 42 "hello"]
]
=== out
Dict({"Mapper": Dict({}), "f": Function(_, q), "result": String("hello")})
